"# SOURCE

## 對應原始碼／Corresponding source

- SDK：@cinderous/client 0.0.0-test（AGPL-3.0-only，全文見 \`LICENSE\`）
- 原始碼／Source：https://github.com/VaalRL/cinderous-sdk/tree/v0.0.0-test
- 這個部署包內含 SDK 的目的碼：\`sdk/\`。
  This package contains SDK object code: \`sdk/\`.

🔴 SDK 目前是私有 repo：上面的連結對沒有權限的人無效。在 SDK 公開之前，**不要把內含 SDK 的部署包交給第三方**（AGPL §6 要求同時提供對應原始碼）。
The SDK repository is currently private, so the link above does not work for people without access. Until the SDK is public, **do not hand a package that contains SDK code to third parties** (AGPL §6 requires providing the corresponding source with it).

## 網路使用者／Network users（AGPL §13）

只改設定、沒改程式：不需要另外提供原始碼。改過中繼程式再讓別人連線使用：要向這些使用者提供修改後的原始碼——把 \`site.relaySoftwareUrl\` 指向它，中繼的 NIP-11 \`software\` 會宣告這個網址。
Changing only the configuration needs nothing more. If you modify the relay program and let others connect to it, offer them your modified source: point \`site.relaySoftwareUrl\` at it and the relay announces it in NIP-11 \`software\`.

目前 NIP-11 software：https://git.example.com/me/fork

## 產生的檔案的授權／License of the generated files

以下由 \`cinderous relay build\` 產生的設定檔與膠水程式另外以 MIT-0 授權（SDK ADR 0050 §7 的例外條款）；JSON 檔沒有註解可放標頭，以這裡為準：
The following config and glue files generated by \`cinderous relay build\` are additionally licensed under MIT-0 (the exception in SDK ADR 0050 §7); JSON files cannot carry a header comment, so this list is authoritative:

- \`cinderous.config.json\`
- \`Dockerfile\`
- \`server.mjs\`
- \`package.json\`
- \`.dockerignore\`
- \`docker-compose.yml\`
- \`.env.example\`
- \`.gitignore\`
- \`README-DEPLOY.md\`
- \`README-DEPLOY.en.md\`
- \`SOURCE.md\`
- \`.cinderous-generated\`

\`\`\`
MIT No Attribution

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this
software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal in the Software
without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify,
merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to
permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A
PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT
HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION
OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE
SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.
\`\`\`
"
